  "notes": "No figures. Light for «ربنا أفرغ علينا صبرا». As-Sa'di's «فالله خير وأبقى» (Quran wording) not used. STAGING v4: The magicians' answer to Pharaoh (Al-Muyassar: the magicians said to Pharaoh), same gathering by day: the believing magicians (uncountable, light robes) and Pharaoh (faceless king). They speak (125:1, 126:4); an hourglass for 125:5 (we are returning to our Lord: the passing of life), gone before the close-up on Pharaoh at 126:2; the camera on Pharaoh for 126:2 (you resent us). Their du'a (126:11-16): they raise their hands as it begins (126:11) and again on 126:15, with a hands plate for the supplication (126:12-15); no light plate, no bowing (it could read as bowing to Pharaoh). Nothing of Pharaoh's punishment is drawn."
